    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "If by \"wildmenu\" you mean popup with all completion candidates, then I am afraid adding border to it it is not possible. It uses built-in completion menu which doesn't have this property. See #741.\r\n\r\n> Also does mini.completion wildmenu color not change according to mini.hues and mini.base16?\r\n\r\nIts colors are defined by a set of `PMenu*` highlight groups which [are defined](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/71b5694a2df4f7e3661855eb8e2814980d2e0ac9/lua/mini/hues.lua#L480-L487).\r\n\r\n------\r\n\r\nClosing as not (currently) possible and duplicate.",
